        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Relight a Product for a Seasonal Campaign\n\nChanges the lighting on an existing product photo so it fits a new season without a reshoot. The product's shape and materials stay as they are.\n\n**How it works:** \"Photo\" takes the image you upload. \"Relight\" sends it to a relighting model with a prompt that describes the new light source, and \"Result\" shows the relit photo.\n\n**Try this:** Pick a model on \"Relight\", then swap the prompt for \"cool morning light from behind, pale blue haze\" to get a spring look."
        },
